		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Saucer-eyed, small fey who glows brightly, shedding glitter from their moth wings. Malicious, hateful towards gnomes and halflings.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 19, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 dagger +3 (1d4), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Light Essence</strong>. Lurker is invisible in bright light. If slain, dissolves into glowing dust (as light spell).</p><p></p><p><strong>Light Step</strong>. Teleport from a brightly lit area to another brightly lit area within far.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
